    {
      "id": "text1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 106,
      "width": 424,
      "height": 258,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE OBVIOUS FIX\nScale the Redis Cluster harder\n\nAlready serving tens of millions\nof reads/sec, billions of\nrequests/day, sharded by use case.\n\nCustom serialization (strings +\nprotobuf + Snappy) already\ntripled capacity on the same\nhardware.\n\nBut every client must hold open\nconnections + track topology\nmetadata for EVERY shard.\nMore shards to scale = more\noverhead per client. Rebalancing\nmoves live state across nodes.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "THE OBVIOUS FIX\nScale the Redis Cluster harder\n\nAlready serving tens of millions\nof reads/sec, billions of\nrequests/day, sharded by use case.\n\nCustom serialization (strings +\nprotobuf + Snappy) already\ntripled capacity on the same\nhardware.\n\nBut every client must hold open\nconnections + track topology\nmetadata for EVERY shard.\nMore shards to scale = more\noverhead per client. Rebalancing\nmoves live state across nodes.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
