    {
      "id": "text2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 728,
      "y": 106,
      "width": 424,
      "height": 258,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4c1d95",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "WHAT THEY BUILT\nClusterless (Kvrocks + S3)\n\nKvrocks: RESP protocol on top of\nRocksDB. Ships with native Redis\nclustering -- they turned it off.\n\nOffline pipeline: parquet -> S3\n-> per-shard indexers -> RocksDB\nbackups -> checkpoint to S3.\n\nServing nodes are stateless:\npull backups straight from S3.\nRedis Cluster Manager (RCM) only\nroutes -- no shared cluster state.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "WHAT THEY BUILT\nClusterless (Kvrocks + S3)\n\nKvrocks: RESP protocol on top of\nRocksDB. Ships with native Redis\nclustering -- they turned it off.\n\nOffline pipeline: parquet -> S3\n-> per-shard indexers -> RocksDB\nbackups -> checkpoint to S3.\n\nServing nodes are stateless:\npull backups straight from S3.\nRedis Cluster Manager (RCM) only\nroutes -- no shared cluster state.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
